OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after falling ill in
OL,4,Apolice custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 42-year-old man died after becoming
OL,7,Funwell while in custody at a central
OL,8,FLondon police station.
OL,10,FOfficers found the man unresponsive in
OL,11,Fhis cell at Charing Cross custody suite
OL,12,Fin Westminster at 04:27 BST on 2
OL,13,FOctober, the Metropolitan Police said.
OL,14,FAn investigation has been launched by
OL,15,Fthe Independent Office for Police
OL,16,FConduct (IOPC).
OL,18,FFirst aid was administered by officers
OL,19,Fbefore London Ambulance Service
OL,20,Fparamedics arrived and transferred him
OL,21,Fto hospital, where he died on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
