OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after falling ill in
OL,4,Apolice custody
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man had been arrested on the
OL,7,Fafternoon of 1 October for recall to
OL,8,Fprison. The Met said a standard risk
OL,9,Fassessment to identify medical or other
OL,10,Fissues was completed when he arrived in
OL,11,Fcustody.
